@1 = ~Hydra~

// Summon Hydra (wizard level 9)
@2 = ~Summon Hydra~
@3 = ~Summon Hydra
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 9
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell summons a many-headed hydra to fight for the wizard. It obeys the caster until the spell ends or it is slain.

Hydra: HP 160, AC 0, THAC0 5, 4 attacks per round with its heads (2d6+4 piercing damage, +4 weapon). Like a troll, the hydra regenerates 1 hit point per second. It has 50% acid resistance and is immune to poison and fear.~
